00:46:13.770 --> 00:46:20.410
<v Milo>And they were all wearing their robes. And they were walking slowly up the street-- I don't know where they were going-- in a single-file line.
<v Milo>他们都穿着长袍。他们慢慢地沿着街道走着——我不知道他们要去哪儿——排成一列。

